> Is it better to use weaponse or not?  If so does the weapon matter?

In Slash'em, Monks are really better while unarmed (they manage to do 
enough damage at high level to be comparable to fairly good weapons).

> Is it better to wear armor or not?  If so what armor?

No body armor except robes. Wearing a body armor give to-hit malus, plus 
it effectively erase a monk-specific (and slashem-specific) bonus to AC 
(dependant on your level). So at low level, the to-hit malus is too 
important and at high level the AC gain is not important enough. Notice 
that some situations makes wearing body armour for their special 
propeties interesting (typically the Guild where you really want to have 
drain resistance and wearing a [SD]DSM becomes a good idea).

